user, ",[299,465,466],{},"try","\u002F",[299,469,470],{},"catch"," inside the action, show a message and return ",[299,473,450],{},", as in the example above.",[442,476,477,479,480,482],{},[445,478,390],{},": the switch is disabled, so the action is not called twice. If the page changes ",[299,481,375],{}," while pending, the page's value wins and is not overwritten when the action finishes.",[442,484,485,490,491,493,494,310],{},[445,486,487,488],{},"Without ",[299,489,305],{},", ",[299,492,375],{}," updates right after toggling, the same as ",[299,495,309],{},[296,497,498,499,502,503,506,507,310],{},"The ",[299,500,501],{},"SwitchAction"," and ",[299,504,505],{},"SwitchValue"," types can be imported from ",[299,508,509],{},"#shuo-ui\u002Fcomponents\u002FShuoSwitch.vue",[317,511,513],{"id":512},"on-and-off-values","On and off values",[296,515,516,502,519,522,523,502,526,528,529,467,532,535],{},[299,517,518],{},"true-value",[299,520,521],{},"false-value"," are the bound values when on and off, ",[299,524,525],{},"true",[299,527,450],{}," by default. Change them when the back end uses ",[299,530,531],{},"Y",[299,533,534],{},"N","; the action receives these values too.",[342,537],{"name":538},"switch-values",[317,540,542],{"id":541},"size-and-states","Size and states",[296,544,545,546,549,550,553,554,557,558,561,562,565,566,569,570,573,574,577,578,582],{},"When ",[299,547,548],{},"size"," is not set, it follows the ",[299,551,552],{},"UFormField"," size and the site-wide setting, ",[299,555,556],{},"lg"," built in, the same as the other input components. Without a description, the switch height matches an input of the same size (24 to 40px for ",[299,559,560],{},"xs"," to ",[299,563,564],{},"xl","), so it lines up with other fields in the same row. ",[299,567,568],{},"loading"," shows a loading icon and disables the switch; ",[299,571,572],{},"disabled"," follows the form state when not set; ",[299,575,576],{},"skeleton"," covers it with a skeleton of the same size. Se